legacy/mongodb-tools/

# Real MongoDB export used for the 2026-07-09 CP12 migration (real client names, addresses,
# financial records) — highly sensitive PII, same class as legacy/mongodb/ above. Different casing
# ("MongoDB dump" vs "mongodb") means it was NOT covered by the rule above until now; found
# untracked-but-not-ignored during the 2026-07-09 session and fixed immediately, before any commit.
legacy/MongoDB dump/

# Real client case files (scanned IDs, credit bureau reports, selfies) — highly sensitive PII,
# must never enter git history. Only the small curated subset copied into app/frontend/public/
# for the UI preview is tracked.
legacy/sdevtech/

# Legacy Excel exports (real client names/balances: Clients.xlsx, Loan Accounts Details.xlsx,
# Daily Collection Report.xlsx, etc.) — untracked going forward, 2026-07-06 verification pass.
# Deliberately does NOT cover legacy/reports/201 Loan Docs Generator/ — that subfolder is the
# cited ADR-009/ADR-010 evidence base (templates + formula workbook) and stays tracked.
legacy/reports/*.xlsx

# The live, macro-enabled "OFFICIAL CALCULATOR OF EASYCASH" workbook (.xlsm) — this is not a
# template, it's the company's actual current production ledger: real client names, birthdates,
# SSS/TIN numbers, addresses, co-borrower/character-reference PII, and a full edit-history audit
# trail, with entries as recent as this analysis. Same sensitivity class as legacy/sdevtech/ and
# legacy/reports/*.xlsx above — must never enter git history. Added 2026-07-07 after this file was
# found sitting untracked but NOT gitignored (the *.xlsx rule above doesn't match .xlsm).
legacy/reports/*.xlsm

# Real client PII (Manual_Checklists PDFs, Saved Loan Documents, Statements of Account — real
# names, addresses, financial figures) plus the legal document Templates (.docx) used to generate
# them. 2026-07-11: found untracked but NOT gitignored (same class of gap as legacy/MongoDB dump/
# and legacy/reports/*.xlsm above — fixed immediately, before any commit). If/when the Templates
# subfolder is needed as the canonical source for a document-generation feature, copy it
# deliberately into the app's own source tree (e.g. app/backend/templates/) rather than reading
# live from this ignored legacy folder or un-ignoring any part of it.
legacy/Excel LMS Files/

# Local database backups (backup-database.bat output) — never committed.
backups/

# pg_dump exports of the live Postgres DB (real borrower/loan PII) — used to hand off a full
# snapshot between team members' separate local Postgres instances (e.g. MIS Nomer's laptop).
# Same sensitivity class as legacy/MongoDB dump/ above — never committed.
legacy/db-exports/

# Old SDevTech MongoDB backup batch/PowerShell scripts — contains a hardcoded remote DB
